# Shared by every host, like darwin/ in the old Nix setup; hosts/<host>/Brewfile adds the rest.
# local/tableplus lives in this repo (darwin/taps); install.sh links it into Homebrew's tap directory.
# `trusted: true` replaces nix-homebrew's trust.casks (Homebrew refuses non-official tap casks otherwise).
tap "local/tableplus"

